docs {
  The server resets just this stream with REFUSED_STREAM. The error should name the code (or at least say "stream reset"). On HTTP/1.1 the server closes the socket instead.
  
  > **Outcome case.** This request may fail *by design*. Its result is recorded in the runtime var `outcome` and asserted by the next request, **↳ verify: RST_STREAM REFUSED_STREAM**. Run both together (the folder runner does this).
}
